**Phase D: Predictive models.** Anomaly detection, RUL, classification on AI4I-style data with group and time splits. *Tests:* a deliberately random split on time series is flagged as leakage; cost-based threshold beats the default 0.5 on expected cost; RUL scoring penalizes late predictions more than early.

