**Phase G: Agent orchestrator.** Plan, preview, approve, run, Judge gate, bring-your-own-model, read-only MCP server. *Tests:* a prompt injection hidden in a tag description is ignored and flagged; no tool can write to equipment; an unapproved export is blocked; a task that exceeds its budget stops cleanly.

**Phase H: Reports and polish.** Engineering report export, accessibility, performance measurements.

