## 12. DEFINITION OF DONE

The module is done only when: every feature has an honest status label; all acceptance tests in Section 9 have real output; the Judge and Memory run on every calculation; no code path can write to equipment; no secret is in the client; the app builds in CI from a clean checkout; and a new person can follow the README to run and deploy it.